  "acceptance_notes": [
    "Fresh local full headless acceptance on Windows and Ubuntu 24.04, both solvers, BASE/PINOUT, NeoForge 21.1.231 and 21.1.248; 342 catalog jobs.",
    "Twelve fresh serial Windows graphical scenarios include actual inputs, two real TCP clients, and successful Save and Quit or disconnect/save/stop.",
    "The gameplay jar contains no GameTests or acceptance helpers. All executions load the separately frozen matching companion.",
    "Dev.116 focused targeting results retain their original identity; entry-level equivalence allows only the 0.2.6 version metadata to differ.",
    "Full release lanes use CEE 1.1.3. Existing focused CEE 1.1.4, Gauged, CIO and Sable evidence remains separately identified; this does not certify arbitrary third-party builds or all Sable client rendering.",
    "No performance campaign, full graphical gallery, GitHub merge, tag or publication was performed for this qualification.",
    "Publication reuses the completed 342-job and 12-scenario qualification with every tested jar byte-identical. Protected runtime, tests, helper, tool and example source trees are unchanged; documentation and website updates have their own commit.",
    "The original published 0.2.5 benchmark save is included with only 0.2.6 labels and jar metadata changed. Native save bytes are unchanged, no new benchmark ran, and 20 TPS remains uncertified.",
    "Supplemental focused records retain their original dev.116 and dev.115 source identities and logs. Optional third-party jars and private test worlds are not distributed in this verification bundle."
  ],
